# MSDS system repository scope
#
# This repository stores source code, runtime configuration, approved templates,
# active databases, structured evidence and documentation. Generated product
# documents and local recovery material stay on the working disk.

# Local Git metadata: the existing 02 retrieval repository remains independent.
**/.git/

# Python, Node and test runtime data
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.pytest_codex_tmp/
**/.pytest_tmp_codex/
**/.pytest_tmp_codex_db/
**/node_modules/
**/.cas_cache/
**/dist/
**/build/
**/*.log
**/Thumbs.db
**/~$*

# Local backups, scratch work and generated audit/runtime folders
**/_codex_backup/
**/_codex_backups/
**/_codex_work/
**/_codex_runtime/
**/_scratch/
**/_archive/
**/outputs/
**/验证输出/
**/pytest_tmp/
**/audit_output/

# Product MSDS and verification deliverables are not source assets.
03-数据库/MSDS/
03-数据库/测试库/
03-数据库/正式库/入库word  第一批/
03-数据库/正式库/标准字段数据库Excel/导出表/
07-多格式输出/覆写测试/
07-多格式输出/检索输出/

